  The chi-square probability distribution function is given by:

  .. math::

     f(x, k) = \begin{cases}
       \frac{x^{k/2-1}e^{-x/2}}{2^{k/2}\Gamma(k/2)} & x \ge 0 \\
       0 & \mathrm{otherwise}
     \end{cases}

